  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/icon/ICON_0008201">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The first year the data describes. With coverage end, the Dataset Dictionary's Time Period; exported as dcterms:temporal with a dcat:startDate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
